<title>USA: U.S. Office Products Co Q4 oper shr up.</title>
<headline>U.S. Office Products Co Q4 oper shr up.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.32		    $0.20</p>
<p> Oper net		  21,758		   10,370</p>
<p> Revs		     789,993		  491,057</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  69,047		   52,734</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $1.28		    $0.95</p>
<p> Oper net		  78,520		   43,203</p>
<p> Revs		   2,835,875		1,686,430</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  61,174		   45,583</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Year ended April 26.</p>
<p>Q4 results before non-recurring acquisition costs $5.3 million vs $2 million, and restructuring costs $4.4 million vs $2.5 million.</p>
<p>Q4 results before extraordinary loss $838,000 vs $701,000 from early termination of credit facility.</p>
<p>Yr results before acquisitions costs $16.2 million vs $8.1 million, and restructuring costs $4.4 million vs $3.2 million.</p>
<p>Yr results before extraordinary loss $1.5 million vs $701,000 from early termination of credit facility.</p>
